    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d276">

                <pb facs="0504" n="486" sameAs="frus:frus1947v03/pg486"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">840.6362/11–2946</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Under Secretary of State</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Acheson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to Mr. Clark
                        Clifford, Special Counsel to President Truman </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1946-12-05">December 5,
                        1946</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I am attaching a copy of the cable from London<anchor n="1" xml:id="d276-f1"/>
                    transmitting to us the message of the European Coal Organization. There is also
                    a memorandum explaining the composition of the European Coal Organization and a
                    further memorandum explaining why the United <pb facs="0505" n="487"
                        xml:id="pg487"/> States loadings in October and November fell short of the
                    program by fifty per cent.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d276-f2"/>
                </p>
                <p>I asked the President whether he wished the Department to make this message
                    public. The President desired to consider making it public in or in connection
                    with his speech on Sunday evening. Unless and until we hear from you, the
                    Department will take no further action.<anchor n="3" xml:id="d276-f3"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dean Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d276-f1" n="1" xml:id="d276-f1-content">
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Supra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d276-f2" n="2" xml:id="d276-f2-content">
                <p>Neither attached to file copy.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d276-f3" n="3" xml:id="d276-f3-content">
                <p>The walk-out ended December 6, and no radio address was made by the
                    President.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
